title: Genesis 23 – The Death of Sarah
description: A verse-by-verse study of Genesis 23: Sarah dies at an hundred and seven and twenty years, mother Sarah and Mary, the cave of Machpelah, Sarah's life as an allegory of faithful Israel, and the lesson of Galatians 4, do ye not hear the law?
