context: Genesis 23

# Genesis series pattern (Genesis 1-5). Slide text is the author's own words from the Genesis 23 study (posts 7130,
# 7131, 7132, 7133, 14 December 2022). The study speaks to Sarah's death (vv. 1-2) and then to her life as an
# allegory; the purchase of the field and cave of Machpelah (vv. 3-20) is read through, and the allegory and the
# Galatians lesson follow as the author's applications. Hebrews 11, Genesis 21, Luke 1 and Galatians 3-4, which the
# study quotes, are shown as cross references.
# Fixed: "Issac, conceived in faith" -> "Isaac" (7132); "the adoption by faith that they though was theirs by law" ->
# "thought" (7132). Nothing else.

